@startuml
title MS6 · Réputation — Modèle de classes (S4)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam ClassBorderColor #2E5A88
skinparam ArrowColor #2E5A88
skinparam FontName Helvetica
skinparam FontSize 12
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
skinparam NoteBorderColor #D9A400

enum ReputationEventType <<enumeration>> {
  CHALLENGE_WON
  SUBMISSION_PASSED
  SUBMISSION_REJECTED
}

class ReputationEvent <<event>> {
  +type: ReputationEventType
  +developerId: UUID
  +challengeId: UUID
  +weight: int
  +occurredAt: LocalDateTime
  --
  +ingest(ReputationEvent e): void {static}
  +isDuplicate(): boolean
  +applyTo(ReputationProfile p): void
}

class ReputationProfile <<aggregate>> {
  +developerId: UUID
  +score: int
  +challengesWon: int
  +submissionsPassed: int
  +skills: List~String~
  +updatedAt: LocalDateTime
  --
  +of(UUID developerId): ReputationProfile {static}
  +apply(ReputationEvent e): void
  +recompute(): void
  +addBadge(Badge b): void
}

class Badge <<entity>> {
  +id: String
  +code: String
  +label: String
  +awardedAt: LocalDateTime
  --
  +award(String code, UUID developerId): Badge {static}
  +matches(String code): boolean
}

class RankingEntry <<read model>> {
  +rank: int
  +developerId: UUID
  +displayName: String
  +score: int
  --
  +build(List~ReputationProfile~ profiles, String skill): List~RankingEntry~ {static}
}

class Developer <<external>> {
  +id: UUID
  +displayName: String
  +skills: List~String~
}

ReputationEvent "0..*" ..> "1" ReputationProfile : agrège
ReputationProfile "1" *-- "0..*" Badge : détient
ReputationProfile "1" --> "0..1" RankingEntry : projeté dans
Developer "1" --> "1" ReputationProfile : developerId (réf.)
ReputationEvent --> ReputationEventType : type

note right of ReputationProfile
  Score agrégé à partir des événements
  winners.declared et verification.completed.
  Idempotence par (type, developerId, challengeId).
  Base H2 dédiée à MS6.
end note

note bottom of RankingEntry
  Classement global, filtrable par compétence
  (skill), pagination Page~T~.
  displayName répliqué depuis MS2 (référence).
end note

legend bottom left
  <<external>> : profil possédé par MS2, référencé par son identifiant.
  <<read model>> : projection calculée, non persistée comme agrégat.
end legend
@enduml
